    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004f e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0004f-s " data-id="e0004f" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0004f">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004g-s " data-id="e0004g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004g">
    			<img decoding="async" class="e-image-base e-ykrhga-e0004h-s" data-interaction-id="e0004h" id="190" src="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-ridgeline-roofing-damage_detail.jpg" width="1024" height="768" srcset="http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-ridgeline-roofing-damage_detail.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-ridgeline-roofing-damage_detail-300x225.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1:8950/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/exjsx-ridgeline-roofing-damage_detail-768x576.jpg 768w" alt="Close detail of storm-damaged shingles with granule loss"/>		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004i-s " data-id="e0004i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004i">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004j">GRANULE LOSS, KESTREL ROAD, LAST APRIL</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004k">This one was approved in eleven days because the homeowner had ground photos before the cleanup crew came through.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004l e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004l-s " data-id="e0004l" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004l">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004m-s " data-id="e0004m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004m">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004n-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004n">STORM DAMAGE</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0004o" class="e-ykrhga-e0004o-s e-heading-base">What to photograph before you call anyone.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004p">Before you call anyone, photograph the ground: shingle granules in the gutter, dented soft metal, and the north slope. That is what an adjuster wants.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004q-s " data-id="e0004q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004q">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004r e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004r-s " data-id="e0004r" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004r">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004s">1</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004t-s " data-id="e0004t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004t">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004u" class="e-ykrhga-e0004u-s e-heading-base">The gutter, not the roof</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004v">Shingle granules pooled in the gutter trough and at the downspout outlet. Granule loss dates the hit better than anything on the roof does.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004w-s " data-id="e0004w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004w">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0004x-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0004x">2</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0004y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0004y-s " data-id="e0004y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0004y">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0004z" class="e-ykrhga-e0004z-s e-heading-base">Anything soft and metal</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00050-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00050">Gutters, downspouts, vents, the aluminium trim, the garage door, the grill lid. Dents in soft metal prove hail size when the shingles are ambiguous.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00051 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00051-s " data-id="e00051" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00051">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00052-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00052">3</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00053 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00053-s " data-id="e00053" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00053">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00054" class="e-ykrhga-e00054-s e-heading-base">The north slope</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00055-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00055">It weathers hardest and adjusters check it first. Shoot it from the ground with something in frame for scale — a tape, a coin, your hand.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00056 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00056-s " data-id="e00056" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00056">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00057-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00057">4</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00058 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00058-s " data-id="e00058" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00058">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e00059" class="e-ykrhga-e00059-s e-heading-base">Time and date, before cleanup</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005a">Photograph before anyone picks anything up, and keep the original files. A phone photo carries the timestamp the claim will be argued over.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005b">Do not get on the roof. Nothing you can photograph up there is worth the fall, and we shoot it properly for you at no charge.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005c-s " data-id="e0005c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005c">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005d e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005d-s " data-id="e0005d" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005d">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005e-s " data-id="e0005e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005e">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005f-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005f">WHO TURNS UP</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e0005g" class="e-ykrhga-e0005g-s e-heading-base">Two crews. You are told which one, by name, when you sign.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005h e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e0005h-s " data-id="e0005h" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e0005h">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005i-s " data-id="e0005i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005i">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005j e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005j-s " data-id="e0005j" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005j">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005k" class="e-ykrhga-e0005k-s e-heading-base">Crew One — tear-offs</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005l-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005l">61 YRS COMBINED</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005m e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005m-s " data-id="e0005m" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005m">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005n-s " data-id="e0005n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005n">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005o-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005o"><strong>Marcus Deel</strong> — foreman, 24 years on the tools. Runs every tear-off and does the attic check himself.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005p"><strong>Ray Ortiz</strong> — 19 years. Flashing and valleys; the reason we rarely go back to a chimney twice.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005q-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005q"><strong>Dev Whitaker</strong> — 11 years. Deck repair, ridge vent, and the magnet sweep before the truck leaves.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005r-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005r"><strong>Callum Reyes</strong> — 7 years. Ground, loading, and the tarp that goes on if the weather turns.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005s">Starts at 7am, off your street by 5pm, same four faces every day of the job.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005t-s " data-id="e0005t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005t">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005u-s " data-id="e0005u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005u">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0005v" class="e-ykrhga-e0005v-s e-heading-base">Crew Two — repairs and gutter</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005w-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005w">38 YRS COMBINED</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005x e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005x-s " data-id="e0005x" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005x">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0005y e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0005y-s " data-id="e0005y" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0005y">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0005z-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0005z"><strong>Tomas Vance</strong> — foreman, 16 years on the tools. Leak diagnosis, low-slope TPO, and every emergency tarp.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00060-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00060"><strong>Priya Nandakumar</strong> — 13 years. Runs the seamless gutter machine and sets every hanger line.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00061-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00061"><strong>Owen Brackett</strong> — 9 years. Skylights, boots, and the small repairs nobody else will drive out for.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00062-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00062">This is the crew on the phone at 6am after a storm. Tarping is same day inside the county.</p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00063 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00063-s " data-id="e00063" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00063">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00064 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00064-s " data-id="e00064" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00064">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00065 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00065-s " data-id="e00065" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00065">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00066-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00066">INSURANCE</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00067" class="e-ykrhga-e00067-s e-heading-base">Claim help, plainly explained.</h2>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00068-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00068">We are roofers, not public adjusters. We do not take a percentage of your claim and we do not ask you to sign anything over to us.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00069-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00069"><a href="tel:+15555550142" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		Talk it through: (555) 555-0142
	</a></p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006a e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006a-s " data-id="e0006a" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006a">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006b e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006b-s " data-id="e0006b" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006b">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006c e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006c-s " data-id="e0006c" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006c">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006d">STEP 01</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006e-s " data-id="e0006e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006e">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006f" class="e-ykrhga-e0006f-s e-heading-base">We inspect and document, free, before you file</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006g-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006g">Photos, measurements, and a written scope in the format adjusters read. If there is no claim in it, we say so and you have lost nothing but an hour.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006h-s " data-id="e0006h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006h">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006i e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006i-s " data-id="e0006i" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006i">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006j">STEP 02</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006k e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006k-s " data-id="e0006k" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006k">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006l" class="e-ykrhga-e0006l-s e-heading-base">You file it, in your name, from your account</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006m-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006m">It is your policy and your claim number. We will sit at the kitchen table while you make the call, but the claim never runs through us.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006n e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006n-s " data-id="e0006n" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006n">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006o e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006o-s " data-id="e0006o" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006o">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006p-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006p">STEP 03</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006q e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006q-s " data-id="e0006q" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006q">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006r" class="e-ykrhga-e0006r-s e-heading-base">We meet the adjuster on the roof</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006s-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006s">Two people looking at the same slope on the same day settles most disagreements. When the scope comes back short, we send the supplement with the photos attached.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006t e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006t-s " data-id="e0006t" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006t">
    
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006u e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006u-s " data-id="e0006u" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006u">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006v-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006v">STEP 04</p>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006w e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006w-s " data-id="e0006w" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006w">
    			<h3 data-interaction-id="e0006x" class="e-ykrhga-e0006x-s e-heading-base">You pay the deductible, and nothing more</h3>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0006y-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0006y">Anyone offering to waive or absorb your deductible is committing fraud with your name on it. We will not, and you should hang up on whoever does.</p>
		
</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0006z e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0006z-s " data-id="e0006z" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0006z">
    
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00070 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00070-s " data-id="e00070" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00070" id="book">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00071 e-con e-atomic-element e-grid-base e-ykrhga-e00071-s " data-id="e00071" data-element_type="e-grid" data-e-type="e-grid" data-interaction-id="e00071">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00072 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00072-s " data-id="e00072" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00072">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00073 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00073-s " data-id="e00073" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00073">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00074-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00074">BOOK THE WALK-ROUND</p>
					<h2 data-interaction-id="e00075" class="e-ykrhga-e00075-s e-heading-base">Get a fixed quote.</h2>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00076 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00076-s " data-id="e00076" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00076">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e00077-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00077">AVAILABILITY</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e00078-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e00078">Next open start date: 9 days out. Emergency tarping same day.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e00079 e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e00079-s " data-id="e00079" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e00079">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007a-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007a"><strong>1.</strong> Marcus or Tomas calls you back inside one working day, from a local number.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007b-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007b"><strong>2.</strong> We walk the roof and the attic, 45 minutes, no sales script and nobody sits in your kitchen for two hours.</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007c-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007c"><strong>3.</strong> A one-page fixed price by email the next morning, with the crew name and the start date on it.</p>
		
</div>
			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007d-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007d">Leaking right now? Do not use the form — call the yard on <strong>(555) 555-0142</strong> and someone will pick up between 7am and 6pm.</p>
		
</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007e e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007e-s " data-id="e0007e" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007e">
    		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007f elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="e0007f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
					
<form class="rl-book" action="mailto:yard@ridgelineroofgutter.example" method="post" enctype="text/plain" onsubmit="return false" style="font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;">
  <p style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;color:#151719;margin:0 0 6px;">Book a walk-round</p>
  <p style="font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#37474F;margin:0 0 24px;">Six fields. It goes to the yard, not to a lead broker, and it is never sold on.</p>

  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 18px;">
    <div style="margin:0 0 18px;">
      <label style="display:block;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#37474F;margin:0 0 7px;" for="rl-name">Your name</label>
      <input style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#151719;background:#FBFAF7;border:1px solid #D6D2CB;padding:13px 14px;outline:none;border-radius:0;" id="rl-name" name="name" type="text" required placeholder="Jane Alderman">
    </div>
    <div style="margin:0 0 18px;">
      <label style="display:block;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#37474F;margin:0 0 7px;" for="rl-phone">Phone</label>
      <input style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#151719;background:#FBFAF7;border:1px solid #D6D2CB;padding:13px 14px;outline:none;border-radius:0;" id="rl-phone" name="phone" type="tel" required placeholder="(555) 555-0100">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin:0 0 18px;">
    <label style="display:block;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#37474F;margin:0 0 7px;" for="rl-address">Property address in Whitcomb County</label>
    <input style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#151719;background:#FBFAF7;border:1px solid #D6D2CB;padding:13px 14px;outline:none;border-radius:0;" id="rl-address" name="address" type="text" required placeholder="14 Kestrel Road, Marlow">
  </div>

  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 18px;">
    <div style="margin:0 0 18px;">
      <label style="display:block;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#37474F;margin:0 0 7px;" for="rl-job">What is happening</label>
      <select style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#151719;background:#FBFAF7;border:1px solid #D6D2CB;padding:13px 14px;outline:none;border-radius:0;" id="rl-job" name="job">
        <option>Full re-roof</option>
        <option>Leak or flashing repair</option>
        <option>Storm damage, maybe a claim</option>
        <option>Gutters or guards</option>
        <option>Flat or low-slope section</option>
        <option>Not sure — please look</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div style="margin:0 0 18px;">
      <label style="display:block;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#37474F;margin:0 0 7px;" for="rl-when">Start window that suits you</label>
      <select style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#151719;background:#FBFAF7;border:1px solid #D6D2CB;padding:13px 14px;outline:none;border-radius:0;" id="rl-when" name="when">
        <option>As soon as you can (9 days out)</option>
        <option>Within the month</option>
        <option>Next quarter, planning ahead</option>
        <option>Emergency — I need a tarp today</option>
      </select>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin:0 0 18px;">
    <label style="display:block;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#37474F;margin:0 0 7px;" for="rl-notes">Anything you have already noticed</label>
    <textarea style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;color:#151719;background:#FBFAF7;border:1px solid #D6D2CB;padding:13px 14px;outline:none;border-radius:0;height:104px;resize:vertical;" id="rl-notes" name="notes" rows="4" placeholder="Stain on the landing ceiling after the April storm. Granules in the front gutter."></textarea>
  </div>

  <button type="submit" style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;background:#E8501B;border:0;border-radius:0;padding:18px 24px;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 0 #151719;">Get a fixed quote</button>

  <p style="font-family:Barlow,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#37474F;margin:16px 0 0;">Marcus or Tomas calls back inside one working day. No financing pitch, no third party, no 9pm follow-ups.</p>
</form>
<style>
  .rl-book input:focus, .rl-book select:focus, .rl-book textarea:focus { border-color: #E8501B; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(232,80,27,.18); }
  .rl-book button:hover { background: #151719; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 0 #E8501B; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .rl-book div[style*="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr"] { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>				</div>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007g e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007g-s " data-id="e0007g" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007g">
    <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e0007h e-con e-atomic-element e-flexbox-base e-ykrhga-e0007h-s " data-id="e0007h" data-element_type="e-flexbox" data-e-type="e-flexbox" data-interaction-id="e0007h">
    			<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007i-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007i">RIDGELINE ROOF &amp; GUTTER · WHITCOMB COUNTY</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007j-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007j">Licensed and insured · WC-ROOF-40118 · Yard at 2210 Kestrel Road, open 7am to 6pm</p>
					<p class="e-ykrhga-e0007k-s e-paragraph-base" data-interaction-id="e0007k"><a href="tel:+15555550142" target="_self" class="e-paragraph-link-base">
		(555) 555-0142
	</a></p>
		
</div>

</div>

</div>
